# `#540` (lcaisaphys) PASS 1 -- the dedicated adversarial job: an equivalence check, a premise audit, a cell map

    VERDICT: GO | GO-WITH-CHANGES | NO-GO -- <one line naming the deciding item>

**Put the verdict line first.**  The tree under review is `GXEMUL-SEC/` at commit `e0be9b2`, where `dev_lca.c` is
unchanged since `8bd97e4`.  Ignore any other `src/` under the project root.  Those copies are pristine 2021 upstream,
and their line numbers differ by hundreds.

**Read ONLY these files. Do not browse anything else:**

    GXEMUL-SEC/src/devices/dev_lca.c        DEVICE_ACCESS(lca_isa), and LCA_ISA_BASE at its #define
    GXEMUL-SEC/src/cpus/memory_rw.c         the translate step, the device dispatch, and every read of `cache'
    GXEMUL-SEC/src/cpus/memory_alpha.c      alpha_translate_v2p()
    GXEMUL-SEC/src/devices/bus_isa.c        where the ISA devices are registered at the portbase
    GXEMUL-SEC/regress/lca_isaphys_probe.py the rung-3 witness (13 rows)

**The proposed fix.**  In `DEVICE_ACCESS(lca_isa)`, both nested `cpu->memory_rw(...)` forwards to
`LCA_ISA_BASE + relative_addr` change their misc flags from `CACHE_NONE` to `CACHE_NONE | PHYSICAL`, on the write call
and on the read call.  The reason: `LCA_ISA_BASE + port` is the PHYSICAL address the ISA devices were registered at.
Without `PHYSICAL` it is translated as a VIRTUAL address, and translation is identity only while ptbr == 0.

## TASK 1 -- EQUIVALENCE, candidate by candidate

For each candidate below, say **EQUIVALENT** or **DIFFERENT** relative to the proposed fix.  If DIFFERENT, name the
first input at which the two differ: ptbr state, direction, port, access width, or lane `(relative_addr & 3) % len`.
Also name which rows of `lca_isaphys_probe.py` observe that difference and which stay green.  If no row observes it,
say **NO ROW**.

    (a)  PHYSICAL on the write call only
    (b)  PHYSICAL on the read call only
    (c)  NO_EXCEPTIONS | PHYSICAL on both calls
    (d)  bare PHYSICAL on both calls (CACHE_NONE dropped)
    (e)  PHYSICAL on both, but only when relative_addr < 0x200 (i.e. not for the ns16550 at 0x3f8)
    (f)  PHYSICAL on both, but only when relative_addr >= 0x200
    (g)  PHYSICAL on both, AND the read arm returns the inner call's status instead of the unconditional `return 1`

Then list every candidate that comes back **NO ROW**.  An unseen weakening means the witness, once it becomes the
detector, has a gap.

## TASK 2 -- PREMISE AUDIT, with file:line for each

Mark each premise TRUE, FALSE or UNSETTLED-FROM-THESE-FILES, and cite the line that settles it:

    P1  memory_rw skips translate_v2p entirely when misc_flags carries PHYSICAL.
    P2  alpha_translate_v2p is identity for a K0SEG vaddr in supervisor mode, and identity when the ptbr base is 0.
    P3  with ptbr != 0 and a zero L1 entry, the walk prints "wasn't found" and returns 0; memory_rw then zeroes a
        READ buffer and returns MEMORY_ACCESS_FAILED.
    P4  every ISA device reached through LCA_ISA_BASE is registered DM_DEFAULT, so NO_EXCEPTIONS would make memory_rw
        skip its handler.  (I checked the five registrations: dev_ns16550.c, dev_8259.c, dev_8253.c, dev_pccmos.c and
        dev_pckbc.c all pass DM_DEFAULT.  Check bus_isa.c for any device it registers some other way.)
    P5  for a device address, CACHE_NONE | PHYSICAL and bare PHYSICAL take the SAME path through memory_rw.
        ENUMERATE every read of the `cache' value in memory_rw.c and say which ones a device address reaches.
    P6  in the witness, the OUTER access is made through K0SEG, so after the arm only the INNER forward walks.
    P7  lca_isa's read arm ignores the inner call's return value and returns 1 regardless.

## TASK 3 -- THE CELL MAP, clause (d)

The fix adds no predicate.  It changes a flag on two calls, so the guarded body is the whole function.  Enumerate
the cells the function's own code distinguishes: direction {read, write} x ptbr {0, armed}.  Add any further axis
the body really tests, such as `len == 0` or the lane `ofs`.  For each cell, say which probe row goes red when the
fix is absent **in that cell only**.  If no row does, say **NO ROW**, and say whether the cell is reachable by a guest.

**Anything else you found while verifying a claim: say so, briefly.**
