GXEMUL-SEC/regress/lca_isaphys_probe.py:106: P_ZERO, P_RAM, P_PCB = 0x01050000, 0x01056000, 0x01058000
GXEMUL-SEC/regress/lca_isaphys_probe.py:107: PAGESHIFT = 13
GXEMUL-SEC/regress/lca_isaphys_probe.py:108: ZERO_PFN  = P_ZERO >> PAGESHIFT               # 0x828.  NOT 0: ptbr 0 is the identity path
