GXEMUL-SEC/regress/lca_isaphys_probe.py:110: #  *** THE SPEC'S PFN IS WRONG, AND THIS ASSERT IS HOW IT WAS CAUGHT. ***  The spec writes "PFN
GXEMUL-SEC/regress/lca_isaphys_probe.py:111: #  0x01050000 >> 13 = 0x20a0"; the shift gives 0x828 (0x20a0 is the >> 11 value).  COMPUTED here,
