The proposed two-call fix is sound. The changes needed are to detector coverage and premise wording. This is a static review of the five permitted files; the outcomes below are predictions, not new runs.

For the comparisons, `port` means `relative_addr` **after** `>>= 5`; `len` is the outer access width. Every inner forward transfers one byte. “Armed” means the witness’s nonzero PTBR with zero `L1[0]`.

